Name:Rules pilot 143 - Still a Mountain after Turn
Goal:Survive
Turns:1
Difficulty:Medium
Description:It is your first main phase. You control Mishra's Factory, three Mountains and an Island, and have Turn // Burn in hand. The opponent is at 2 life and controls Magus of the Moon and Leyline of Sanctity. Win this turn.
Rule:rulesguru-a27b294b03fe7138 | Magus of the Moon's type change applies in layer 4 before Turn removes its ability in layer 6 (CR 613.1d, 613.1f, 613.5), so a Turned Magus still makes nonbasic lands Mountains
